 "summary": "Two separate NPN small-signal transistors in a six-lead SOT363 package, for switching and medium-power amplifier stages. The ratings are 40 V collector to emitter and 200 mA of collector current; the package dissipates 200 mW in total at 25 °C ambient. MMDT3904-7-F is the AEC-Q101 qualified, lead-free and halogen-free part, marked K6N, on 7-inch reels of 3,000.",
